{{BB = BIG BIRD}}
{{BW = BAD WOLF}}
{{RF = RED FOX}}
{{C = command}}

*/

> Characters <
Ship
Nasa Engineer
Bad Wolf
Red Fox
Big Bird
Ronald Reagan

===


INT. Challenger

SHIP
5 (beat) 4 (beat) 3 (beat) 2 (beat) 1

NASA ENGINEER (V.O.)
All units standing by

{{BW}}
{{BW}} standing by

{{RF}}
{{RF}} standing by

{{BW}} and {{RF}} hear some wrestling behind them

{{BB}}
{{BB}} standing by

{{BW}}
What the fuck!

{{RF}} ^
Holy shit! You shouldn't be here!

{{BB}}
HI Y'ALL. {{BB}} HERE!

{{BB}} gestures in a waving fashion using his right hand and is carrying a piece of metal

{{BW}}
{{BB}} you are not supposed to be here! {{BW}} to {{C}}. {{BW}} to {{C}}. Stall the launch {{C}}.

NASA ENGINEER	
Roger

SHIP
The launch has been stopped


{{RF}}
Awww how sweet! My kids love watching Sesame Street every Saturday morning! But you really shouldn't be here

{{BB}}
{{BB}} loves spending time with his friends!

{{BW}}
I've heard rumors of The Yellow Menace. I thought it was a myth. Hey what's that in your hand?

{{BB}}
Oh {{BB}} couldn't get through the door so I cut off a piece of the door frame!

{{RF}}	
{{RF}} to {{C}}. {{RF}} to {{C}}. 

The crew only hears static

{{RF}} (CONT'D)
Come on KEVIN. Please respond buddy.

{{BW}}
(panicked)
Hey man you really need to get out of here now!

NASA ENGINEER (V.O.)
(statically)
-melia Ear-

{{RF}}
KEVIN? Did you say something? What did you say KEVIN? Come in KEVIN!

{{BB}}	
AMELIA EARHART! {{BB}} knows her! She's {{BB}} friend! I haven't seen her in a bit! Yeah I put some sugar in her engine to help sweeten her ride. I didn't like the smell of the gasoline, so I thought this might help. {{BB}} hopes that she's doing okay!

{{RF}}	
I'm so stressed out right now!

{{BB}}
{{BB}} is concerned about how you two are feeling. {{BB}} wants to make sure you two are happy

{{BW}}
I'm terrified. I want off this shuttle. I'm like a trapped animal right now

{{RF}}
I just want to see my children again

{{BB}}
Don't worry. {{BB}} will be there for your children. Always

NASA ENGINEER (V.O.)
(statically)
-indenburg-

{{BW}}
indenburg. You don't mean-

{{BB}}
The Hindenburg! Oh yeah! {{BB}} remembers that! {{BB}} was just spending a bunch of time in the air with his friends! There was a safety concern and I made sure everyone was safe. They were all strapped into their seats! {{BB}} hasn't seen them in a while!


{{BW}} and {{RF}} start fumbling with their seats

{{BW}}	
I'm trapped! I'm trapped! {{RF}} he locked us into our seats!

{{RF}}
All I can think about is my family. I miss them so much. Where did I go wrong in life? That's all I want to know. That and if my family is okay

{{BB}}
{{BB}} doesn't like sad feelings and just wants to see his friends smile!

NASA ENGINEER (V.O.)
(statically)
Blitz!

{{BB}}
Oh yeah! {{BB}} helped a bunch of his friends that look like me! They said they needed help looking for their friend Anne. I thought she might be in London, so {{BB}} thought it might be best if they looked into all of the buildings from above by taking off the roofs, but they wanted to go door to door looking for her. Turns out {{BB}} found her in Amsterdam, and told his friends! That was the best game of hide and seek ever! {{BB}} heard she's an author now!

{{RF}}
Oh my god. You are a monster. /* When you said "Hi Y'all"-

{{BB}}
{{BB}} didn't say "Hi y'all". I was greeting you the way his friends greet each other
*/
{{BW}}
I don't know what to say. I finally ran out of words to say

{{BB}} starts ripping out the wires

{{BB}}
Today's color is Blue. As in {{BB}}'s eyes and as in these blue wires shouldn't be touching the red wires. So I made sure that all the blue wires touch each other instead!

{{BW}}
Those are for our oxygen module! We need them so we can breathe in our shuttle while we are in space!

{{RF}}
I'm sorry {{BW}}. I don't have the strength to fight anymore. I have accepted my fate

NASA ENGINEER (V.O.)
(statically)
Death has come for you-

{{BW}}
I can still fight. I can still get us out of here!

{{BB}}
{{BB}} wishes people would stop calling him that! I prefer the name {{BB}}! Death is bad

{{BW}}
You son of a bitch! YOU SON OF A BITCH!

{{BW}} punches {{BB}} in the face

{{BB}}
Hey now that hurt {{BB}}'s feelings! {{BB}} doesn't like that! You hurt {{BB}}'s perfectly blonde feathers

{{BB}} starts messing with the buttons

SHIP (V.O.)
Countdown has been initiated

NASA ENGINEER (V.O.)
The countdown has been started. I'm so sorry {{BW}} and {{RF}}

SHIP (V.O.)
5 (beat) 4 (beat) 3 (beat)


{{RF}}
Oh god

SHIP (V.O.)
2 (beat)

{{BW}}
Goodbye all

SHIP (V.O.)
1

{{BB}}
{{BB}} is going to fly again!

SHIP (V.O.)
Liftoff

>**Black out**<

A light appears on a puppet like RONALD REAGAN eating a chicken leg

RONALD REAGAN
They wouldn't have called it the Challenger if it wasn't challenging. We mourn heroes, pioneers who honored us by living their lives. (Burps) Excuse me. Sorry folks. We'll continue our quest in space. This shuttle launch is brought to you by the letter C for Casualties

{{BB}} appears behind Ronald Reagan as if he is {{BB}}'s puppet
